1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:01,900
(Sheldon:)In any event,

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:05,500
(Sheldon:)now that Amy and I have
spent quality time together,

3
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:07,010
(Sheldon:)I feel much
more confident

4
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:09,510
(Sheldon:)proceeding to the next
stage of our relationship.

5
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:10,880
(Penny:)And that is?

6
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,630
(Sheldon:)Using in vitro
fertilization

7
00:00:12,630 --> 00:00:16,350
(Sheldon:)and a surrogate uterus to
gift humanity with our progeny.

8
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,640
(Penny:)You're still
on that?

9
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:24,560
(Sheldon:)In these uncertain times,
doesn't humanity deserve a gift?

10
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:26,690
(Penny:)Okay, you know what?

11
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:29,140
(Penny:)I'm gonna come at this
in a whole new way.

12
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:32,280
(Penny:)Sheldon, if you try to make
a baby with Amy in a petri dish,

13
00:00:32,280 --> 00:00:34,530
(Penny:)I'm gonna tell
your mother on you.

14
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:36,370
(Sheldon:)That's no threat.

15
00:00:36,370 --> 00:00:38,450
(Sheldon:)My mother's always
wanted a grandchild.

16
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:41,710
(Penny:)Really? Your deeply religious
born-again Christian mother

17
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:44,130
(Penny:)wants a test-tube grandbaby
born out of wedlock?

18
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:49,800
(Sheldon:)Curses.

19
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,720
(Penny:)If I'd thought of that
in the first place,

20
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:53,970
(Penny:)I could've saved myself
this whole night.

21
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:55,470
(Sheldon:)Well, it's not that late.

22
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:58,010
(Sheldon:)You could still go out
and look for number 32.

23
00:01:01,980 --> 00:01:04,810
(Sheldon:)Good night.

24
00:01:04,810 --> 00:01:07,070
(Leonard(phone rings):)Hey, Howard,
what's up?

25
00:01:07,070 --> 00:01:08,970
(Sheldon:)I've decided
not to procreate.

26
00:01:08,970 --> 00:01:11,190
(Leonard:)Yeah, yeah, great.

27
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:13,460
(Leonard:)Howard, uh, slow down.

28
00:01:13,460 --> 00:01:15,030
(Leonard:)What do you mean
it happened again?

